#. ja: シグマスケープ
#. de: Sigmametrie-Kristalloid
#. fr: cristalloïde sigmastitiel
#. column 2: Sigmascape crystalloids
#. column 8: A remarkable crystalline fragment within which can be seen images from another world. Though such articles were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up, leaving them with little value as bartering materials.
#. column 9: Sigmascape Crystalloid
msgctxt "Item:21785:0:0"
msgid "Sigmascape crystalloid"
msgstr "кристаллоид Сигма-осколка"

#. de: Sigmametrie-Kristalloide
#. fr: cristalloïdes sigmastitiels
#. column 0: Sigmascape crystalloid
#. column 8: A remarkable crystalline fragment within which can be seen images from another world. Though such articles were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up, leaving them with little value as bartering materials.
#. column 9: Sigmascape Crystalloid
msgctxt "Item:21785:0:2"
msgid "Sigmascape crystalloids"
msgstr "кристаллоиды Сигма-осколка"

#. ja: シグマ空間内部で手に入れた、謎の景色を映す物体。<br>かつて熱心に収集する好事家がいたが流行は過ぎ去り、今や取引する者はいない
#. de: Ein außer<shy>ge<shy>wöhn<shy>liches Kristallfragment, das einen Blick in eine andere Welt ermöglicht. Einst leckten sich Sammler die Finger nach dieser Rarität, doch heutzutage findet man dafür keine Abnehmer mehr.
#. fr: Un mystérieux objet récupéré dans un engrenage sigmastitiel et dans lequel on aperçoit un étrange paysage. Même si les col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs se les arrachaient autrefois, ils ont depuis perdu en popularité, et plus personne ne les rachète.
#. column 0: Sigmascape crystalloid
#. column 2: Sigmascape crystalloids
#. column 9: Sigmascape Crystalloid
msgctxt "Item:21785:0:8"
msgid "A remarkable crystalline fragment within which can be seen images from another world. Though such articles were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up, leaving them with little value as bartering materials."
msgstr "Необычный осколок кристалла, в котором видны картины иного мира. Когда-то за такими осколками охотились коллекционеры, но мода прошла и теперь их почти невозможно обменять на что-либо."

#. ja: シグマスケープ
