msgctxt "Item:21785:0:9"
msgid "Sigmascape Crystalloid"
msgstr "Кристаллоид Сигма-осколка"

#. ja: 龍脈の強化薬
#. de: Fläschchen[p] Ryumyaku-Lösungsmittel
#. fr: fiole d'agent renforçant Ryûmyaku
#. column 2: flasks of ryumyaku solvent
#. column 8: A dissolving agent concocted by Doman artisans that, when applied to certain weapons, heightens their attributes by removing impurities on their surface. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Ryumyaku Solvent
msgctxt "Item:21786:0:0"
msgid "flask of ryumyaku solvent"
msgstr "флакон растворителя Рюмяку"

#. de: Fläschchen[p] Ryumyaku-Lösungsmittel
#. fr: fioles d'agent renforçant Ryûmyaku
#. column 0: flask of ryumyaku solvent
#. column 8: A dissolving agent concocted by Doman artisans that, when applied to certain weapons, heightens their attributes by removing impurities on their surface. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Ryumyaku Solvent
msgctxt "Item:21786:0:2"
msgid "flasks of ryumyaku solvent"
msgstr "флаконы растворителя Рюмяку"

#. ja: ドマに伝わる秘術を再現した錬金薬。<br>龍脈武器の改良に最適な性質を秘める。<br>かつて【武器】の強化に用いられていたが、今や技術の進歩により必要とされていない
#. de: Ein von domanischen Handwerkern hergestelltes Lösungsmittel, das die Eigenschaften bestimmter Waffen verstärkt.<br>(Wurde zur Verstärkung von Waffen benutzt, ist nun aber nicht mehr erforderlich.)
#. fr: Une mixture alchimique tra<shy>di<shy>tion<shy>nel<shy>le domienne. Elle permettait d'améliorer l'efficacité des armes de style Ryûmyaku. De meilleures techniques ont été inventées depuis sa découverte, et plus personne ne l'utilise aujourd'hui.
#. column 0: flask of ryumyaku solvent
#. column 2: flasks of ryumyaku solvent
#. column 9: Ryumyaku Solvent
msgctxt "Item:21786:0:8"
msgid "A dissolving agent concocted by Doman artisans that, when applied to certain weapons, heightens their attributes by removing impurities on their surface. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete."
msgstr "Растворитель, созданный доманскими ремесленниками. Если нанести его на оружие, он удалит с поверхности загрязнения и усилит его свойства. Но технологии шагнули вперёд, и растворитель устарел."

#. ja: 龍脈の強化薬
#. de: Ryumyaku-Lösungsmittel
#. fr: Agent renforçant Ryûmyaku
#. column 0: flask of ryumyaku solvent
#. column 2: flasks of ryumyaku solvent
#. column 8: A dissolving agent concocted by Doman artisans that, when applied to certain weapons, heightens their attributes by removing impurities on their surface. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
msgctxt "Item:21786:0:9"
msgid "Ryumyaku Solvent"
msgstr "Растворитель Рюмяку"

#. ja: 龍脈の強化繊維
#. de: Bündel[p] Ryumyaku-Gewebe
#. fr: rouleau de fibre renforcée Ryûmyaku
#. column 2: spools of ryumyaku twine
#. column 8: A durable thread used by Doman artisans. When woven into certain armor, it is believed to heighten its attributes. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Ryumyaku Twine
msgctxt "Item:21787:0:0"
msgid "spool of ryumyaku twine"
msgstr "катушка нити Рюмяку"

