#. ja: ドマに伝わる秘術を再現した硬化薬。<br>龍脈宝玉の改良に最適な性質を秘める。<br>かつて【アクセサリ】の強化に用いられていたが、今や技術の進歩により必要とされていない
#. de: Eine von domanischen Goldschmieden hergestellte Paste, die die Eigenschaften bestimmter Schmuckstücke verstärkt.<br>(Wurde zur Verstärkung von Accessoires benutzt, ist nun aber nicht mehr erforderlich.)
#. fr: Une mixture alchimique tra<shy>di<shy>tion<shy>nel<shy>le domienne. Elle permettait d'améliorer l'efficacité des accessoires de style Ryûmyaku. De meilleures techniques ont été inventées depuis sa découverte, et plus personne ne l'utilise aujourd'hui.
#. column 0: phial of ryumyaku polish
#. column 2: phials of ryumyaku polish
#. column 9: Ryumyaku Polish
msgctxt "Item:21788:0:8"
msgid "A slightly corrosive paste concocted by Doman goldsmiths that, when applied to certain accessories, heightens their attributes by restoring their luster. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete."
msgstr "Слегка едкая паста, созданная доманскими ювелирами. Если нанести её на украшение, она вернёт ему блеск и усилит его свойства. Но технологии шагнули вперёд, и паста устарела."

#. ja: 龍脈の硬化薬
#. de: Ryumyaku-Poliermittel
#. fr: Agent solidifiant Ryûmyaku
#. column 0: phial of ryumyaku polish
#. column 2: phials of ryumyaku polish
#. column 8: A slightly corrosive paste concocted by Doman goldsmiths that, when applied to certain accessories, heightens their attributes by restoring their luster. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
msgctxt "Item:21788:0:9"
msgid "Ryumyaku Polish"
msgstr "Полироль Рюмяку"

#. ja: ロウェナの手形:虚構
