#. fr: avoir de Rowena (mensonger/poétique)
#. column 2: Rowena's tokens (mendacity)
#. column 8: A note of promise received from Rowena for the delivery of Allagan tomestones of mendacity or poetics. However, due to the House of Splendors changing its policies, it is now worth less than the paper on which it is scribed.
#. column 9: Rowena's Token (Mendacity)
msgctxt "Item:21789:0:0"
msgid "Rowena's token (mendacity)"
msgstr "знак Ровены (вымысел)"

