msgid "Rowena's Token (Mendacity)"
msgstr "Знак Ровены (вымысел)"

#. ja: 試作型トームストーン
#. de: experimentell[a] Allagisch[a] Stein
#. fr: néomémoquartz allagois
#. column 2: prototype tomestones
#. column 8: Garlond Ironworks engineers believe this device to be an attempt by Allagan scientists to increase tomestone capacity, while keeping overall size relatively small. This may have become the next standard in tomestone data storage...had not their civilization been inconveniently wiped from the realm. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Prototype Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:21790:0:0"
msgid "prototype tomestone"
msgstr "прототип камня"

#. de: experimentell[a] Allagisch[a] Steine
#. fr: néomémoquartz allagois
#. column 0: prototype tomestone
#. column 8: Garlond Ironworks engineers believe this device to be an attempt by Allagan scientists to increase tomestone capacity, while keeping overall size relatively small. This may have become the next standard in tomestone data storage...had not their civilization been inconveniently wiped from the realm. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares.
#. column 9: Prototype Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:21790:0:2"
msgid "prototype tomestones"
msgstr "прототипы камней"

#. ja: 古代の情報が記されたアラグ文明の遺物。新規格の試作品らしい。<br>かつて熱心に収集する好事家がいたが流行は過ぎ去り、今や取引する者はいない
#. de: Ingenieure der Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke vermuten, dass dieses Exemplar den Versuch von allagischen Forschern darstellt, die Kapazität von Allagischen Steinen zu erhöhen und gleichzeitig ihre relativ kleine Größe beizubehalten. Es hätte der neue Standard für die Datensicherung auf Allagischen Steinen werden können<nbsp>... wenn die allagische Zivilisation nicht ausgelöscht worden wäre. Heute interessiert sich offenbar niemand mehr für diese Objekte.
#. fr: Cette pierre, vestige de la civilisation allagoise, renferme des con<shy>nais<shy>san<shy>ces ancestrales. L'avancée technologique a permis la mise au point de ce nouveau prototype. Même si les col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs se les arrachaient autrefois, elles ont depuis perdu en popularité, et plus personne ne les rachète.
#. column 0: prototype tomestone
#. column 2: prototype tomestones
#. column 9: Prototype Tomestone
msgctxt "Item:21790:0:8"
msgid "Garlond Ironworks engineers believe this device to be an attempt by Allagan scientists to increase tomestone capacity, while keeping overall size relatively small. This may have become the next standard in tomestone data storage...had not their civilization been inconveniently wiped from the realm. This particular variety is not as highly sought as it once was, and may no longer be exchanged for other wares."
msgstr "Инженеры «Топсейл» считают, что учёные Аллагской империи пытались увеличить объём памяти камня, сохранив его компактный размер. Это могло стать новым стандартом хранения данных... если бы аллагская цивилизация не канула в небытие. Этот вид камней уже не так ценится, как прежде, и обменять его на другие товары, возможно, больше нельзя."

#. ja: 試作型トームストーン
