#. column 2: tier 1 metal aquariums
#. column 8: A small, reinforced glass tank that, when filled with water, can serve as a home for select wavekin caught in the wild. The higher an aquarium's tier, the larger the specimens that can be kept within.<br>※Private chambers (apartments), cottages, houses, and mansions can host 4, 6, 8, and 10 aquariums, respectively.
#. column 9: Tier 1 Metal Aquarium
msgctxt "Item:21841:0:0"
msgid "tier 1 metal aquarium"
msgstr "металлический аквариум I"

#. de: Metall-Aquarien[p] S
#. fr: aquariums en métal de petite taille
#. column 0: tier 1 metal aquarium
#. column 8: A small, reinforced glass tank that, when filled with water, can serve as a home for select wavekin caught in the wild. The higher an aquarium's tier, the larger the specimens that can be kept within.<br>※Private chambers (apartments), cottages, houses, and mansions can host 4, 6, 8, and 10 aquariums, respectively.
#. column 9: Tier 1 Metal Aquarium
msgctxt "Item:21841:0:2"
msgid "tier 1 metal aquariums"
msgstr "металлические аквариумы I"

#. ja: 特定の水産物を飼育することができる小型の金属製水槽<br>[水槽は種類に関わらず設置できる数が建物サイズで決まる(個室・アパルトメント:4個／S:6個／M:8個／L:10個)]
#. de: Ein kleiner verstärkter Wassertank, in dem bestimmte Fische und Meeresfrüchte gehalten werden können. (Pro Zimmer/Wohnung, Hütte, Haus bzw. Residenz können 4, 6, 8 bzw. 10 Aquarien aufgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Un aquarium métallique de petite taille dans lequel vous pouvez élever certaines de vos plus belles prises.<br>[Les chambres individuelles et appartements peuvent contenir 4 aquariums, les maisonnettes, pavillons et villas sont respectivement limités à 6, 8 et 10.]
#. column 0: tier 1 metal aquarium
#. column 2: tier 1 metal aquariums
#. column 9: Tier 1 Metal Aquarium
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:21841:0:8"
msgid "A small, reinforced glass tank that, when filled with water, can serve as a home for select wavekin caught in the wild. The higher an aquarium's tier, the larger the specimens that can be kept within.<br>※Private chambers (apartments), cottages, houses, and mansions can host 4, 6, 8, and 10 aquariums, respectively."
msgstr "Небольшой аквариум из укреплённого стекла. Наполните его водой — и в нём можно поселить некоторых пойманных в природе водных обитателей. Чем выше уровень аквариума, тем крупнее рыбы в нём поместятся.<br>※В личной комнате, квартире, коттедже, доме и особняке можно разместить соответственно 4, 6, 8 и 10 аквариумов."

